The simplest procedure for installing MAPfastR and all the required binaries is to use the command in R:

install.packages('MAPfastR',repos='http://www.computationalgenetics.se/MAPfastR')

R version 2.15.3 or higher is required.

This will work for Windows and OSX but not for Liux.

